          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Whirling Gaol",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "Once every 4 rounds, the opinicus can create a 20 ft. radius, 60 ft. tall cylindrical tornado within 100 feet of itself as a 1-round action. Any creature other than the opinicus entering the tornado, or within the tornado at the start of its turn, takes 8d6 wind damage and is Dazed for 1 round, a Fortitude save (DC 22) halving the damage and negating the status. Any creature other than the opinicus within 100 feet of the tornado that would not have cover against the tornado is subject to a bull rush attempt at a +30 bonus, pushing that creature towards the center of the tornado. The tornado lasts for 3 rounds.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
